---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";

const lastUpdated = "April 30, 2026";
---

<Base title="Privacy — x1agent" description="What x1agent collects, how it's used, and how to remove it.">
  <Nav />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
    <h1 class="font-sans text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight md:text-4xl">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-faint)]">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
      <section>
        <p>This policy covers x1agent.com (the marketing site) and the x1agent platform itself. The platform is self-hosted — it runs in your Kubernetes cluster, not ours — so most of the data you'll think of as "x1agent data" never reaches us. This page describes what we collect when we do.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">Who we are</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">x1agent is operated by <a href="https://dev360.com" class="underline underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-[var(--color-text)]">DEV360 LLC</a>, a Georgia limited liability company. Contact: <a href="mailto:christian@x1agent.com" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] underline underline-offset-4">christian@x1agent.com</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">What we collect on x1agent.com</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">If you submit the access form, we collect:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
          <li>Your name</li>
          <li>Your work email address</li>
          <li>The free-text answer about what you'd build first (optional)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">No analytics scripts, no advertising trackers, no session replay, no cookies set by us. The site loads fonts from rsms.me and fonts.googleapis.com — those services see your IP address as a side-effect of HTTP, but x1agent doesn't.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">What we collect when you use the platform</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">When you sign in to a self-hosted x1agent deployment with Google OAuth, x1agent receives the data Google sends us under the OAuth scopes you approved. That's stored in <em>your</em> deployment's database — Postgres running in your cluster — not in any database we operate. We never see it.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Specifically: we (the operators of x1agent.com) don't run a multi-tenant SaaS. There's no "your data on our servers" — there's only your data in your cluster.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">How we use what we collect</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
          <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-text)]">Reach out about access</strong> — your name and email so a human can schedule a walk-through.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-text)]">Send occasional product updates</strong> — only the email you submitted, only about x1agent. No third-party promotions.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">Who we share it with</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Two service providers, both as data processors acting on our behalf:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
          <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-text)]">Resend</strong> — sends the notification email and stores your contact in our audience for follow-up. <a href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy" class="underline underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-[var(--color-text)]">Resend's policy</a>.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-text)]">Google Cloud (Cloud Run, Cloud DNS)</strong> — hosts the website you're reading. <a href="https://cloud.google.com/terms/cloud-privacy-notice" class="underline underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-[var(--color-text)]">Google Cloud privacy notice</a>.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">We don't sell your data. We don't share it with advertisers, data brokers, or analytics providers.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">How long we keep it</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Until you ask us to remove it, or until x1agent stops operating — whichever comes first. Server logs (HTTP access records held by Google Cloud Run) are kept for 30 days.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Regardless of where you live, you can:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
          <li>Ask what we have on you</li>
          <li>Ask us to correct it</li>
          <li>Ask us to delete it</li>
          <li>Ask us to export it</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">Email <a href="mailto:christian@x1agent.com" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] underline underline-offset-4">christian@x1agent.com</a> with the request. We respond within a business day. The deletion includes removing your record from Resend.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Residents of the EU/UK have the rights under GDPR/UK GDPR. California residents have the rights under CCPA/CPRA. We honor those without requiring you to invoke them by name.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">Google OAuth — limited use</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">The x1agent platform uses Google OAuth so you can sign in with your Google Workspace account. Use of information received from Google APIs adheres to <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" class="underline underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-[var(--color-text)]">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>, including the Limited Use requirements.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Specifically: we (x1agent.com) don't receive Google account data. The OAuth token is held by your self-hosted x1agent deployment. We don't transfer it, sell it, use it for advertising, or read it.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">Children</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">x1agent is a product for engineers. It's not directed at people under 16, and we don't knowingly collect data from anyone under 16.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">If anything material changes, we update the date at the top and announce it on this page. If you're on the waitlist, you'll get an email when it does.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Privacy questions, deletion requests, anything else: <a href="mailto:christian@x1agent.com" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] underline underline-offset-4">christian@x1agent.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
